sync\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Hit Points</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"1\"><p>1</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"2\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/36px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Armour Class</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"1\"><p>10</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"2\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/24px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/36px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/24px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Size</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"1\"><p>Tiny</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cheesy_Smell\" title=\"Cheesy Smell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp/40px-Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp/60px-Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp/80px-Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cheesy Smell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp/40px-Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cheesy_Smell\" title=\"Cheesy Smell\">Cheesy Smell</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Create a cloud of gas so pungent it prevents creatures within it from taking actions. </dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/40px-Jump_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/60px-Jump_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/80px-Jump_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jump\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp/40px-Jump_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Jump_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> + <span aria-label=\"Movement Speed\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Movement Speed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Jump to a destination. \n\nYour <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> affects how far you can jump. </dd>\n</dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Also grants immunity to <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(status_group)\" title=\"Poisoned (status group)\">Poisoned</a></span> conditions</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Polymorph\">Sources of Polymorph</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Careful_What_You_Wish_For\" title=\"Careful What You Wish For\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Polymorph_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorph_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Polymorph_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorph_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Polymorph_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorph_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Careful What You Wish For\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Polymorph_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorph_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Polymorph_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Careful_What_You_Wish_For\" title=\"Careful What You Wish For\">Careful What You Wish For</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>POLYMORPH</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Alternate_Form:_Dire_Wolf\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Dire_Wolf_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Dire Wolf (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alternate Form: Dire Wolf\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Dire_Wolf_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Dire Wolf (Condition)\">Alternate Form: Dire Wolf</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Transformed into a Dire Wolf in all the ways that matter.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Alternate_Form:_Minotaur\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Minotaur_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Minotaur (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alternate Form: Minotaur\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Minotaur_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Minotaur (Condition)\">Alternate Form: Minotaur</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Transformed into a Minotaur in all the ways that matter.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Alternate_Form:_Phase_Spider\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Phase_Spider_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Phase Spider (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alternate Form: Phase Spider\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Phase_Spider_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Phase Spider (Condition)\">Alternate Form: Phase Spider</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Transformed into a Phase Spider in all the ways that matter.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Alternate_Form:_Shadow_Mastiff\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Shadow_Mastiff_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate_Form:_Shadow_Mastiff_(Condition)\" title=\"Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff (Condition)\">Alternate Form: Shadow Mastiff</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Transformed into a Shadow Mastiff in all the ways that matter.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Big_Pig\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Big_Pig_(Condition)\" title=\"Big Pig (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Big Pig\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Big_Pig_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Big_Pig_(Condition)\" title=\"Big Pig (Condition)\">Big Pig</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Pigs are smart and pigs are fun - that's why Dolly made you one!</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Cattle_Prattle\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cattle_Prattle_(Condition)\" title=\"Cattle Prattle (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cattle Prattle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Cattle_Prattle_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cattle_Prattle_(Condition)\" title=\"Cattle Prattle (Condition)\">Cattle Prattle</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Want to converse like a cow? Dolly Thrice will show you how.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Polymorph\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorph (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorph\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Polymorph</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>You are now a particularly ripe wheel of cheese, unpleasant to the nostril.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Polymorph_Self\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph_Self_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorph Self (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorph Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorph_Self_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorph Self (Condition)\">Polymorph Self</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Transformed into a blue jay, able to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(class_action)\" title=\"Fly (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/25px-Fly_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/38px-Fly_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/50px-Fly_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp/25px-Fly_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Fly_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(class_action)\" title=\"Fly (class action)\">Fly</a> for 5 rounds.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Polymorphed\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorphed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\">Polymorphed</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Creature is turned into a harmless sheep with 3 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> for 5 turns.</li>\n<li>If the sheep's Hit Points are reduced to 0, the creature reverts to its original form with its original Hit Points.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Polymorphed\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Tressym)_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Tressym) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorphed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Polymorphed_Tressym_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Tressym)_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Tressym) (Condition)\">Polymorphed</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Changed into a beast.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Toad_Mode\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Toad_Mode_(Condition)\" title=\"Toad Mode (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Toad Mode\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Toad_Mode_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Toad_Mode_(Condition)\" title=\"Toad Mode (Condition)\">Toad Mode</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>If you do not want to think, Dolly Thrice will make you shrink.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715164408\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.117 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.125 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5305/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 75193/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13394/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.063/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1638936/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   97.309      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   97.309      1 -total\n 28.54%   27.771     18 Template:Icon_text\n 26.75%   26.029      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 23.79%   23.149     14 Template:Icon_link\n 23.48%   22.843     48 Template:Trim\n 17.82%   17.341     11 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 14.33%   13.941      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 12.42%   12.088      5 Template:Template_